# Midpoint of HP lemma — for any point P on the circumcircle, the midpoint of P and the orthocenter H lies on the nine-point circle (source: Evan Chen, EGMO)
A B C = triangle
H = orthocenter(A, B, C)
P = on_circum(A, B, C)
Ma = midpoint(B, C)
Mb = midpoint(C, A)
Mc = midpoint(A, B)
Mp = midpoint(H, P)
prove cyclic(Ma, Mb, Mc, Mp)
